    "content": "Deploy drones Drone 9, Drone 4, Drone 2, and Drone 8 for perimeter search. All take off to 28 meters altitude. Position Drone 9 at guard point (409,856,28), Drone 4 at guard point (696,611,28), Drone 2 at guard point (400,196,28), and Drone 8 at west guard point (363,533,28). All drones hover, take photos at their positions, and maintain search.",
